{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"装苑×文化学園スペシャルトークショー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Presented by パナソニック「衣類スチーマー」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった皆様、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/03/02/5745427/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じで、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"児島編集長と千原徹也さんとトーク。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はじめて装苑に載ったのが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"千原さんがデザインした表紙の"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リニューアル号と気づいて驚いた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パナソニックの衣類スチーマーは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ラウンドタイプを元々愛用していましたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の講義は使い方だったり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またひとつ勉強になったな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもお世話になります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"使いやすいしおすすめですー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/03/02/5745427/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終了後、楽屋に戻ったらケーキが、、！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ああー、うれしい、、！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか、こんな分際で、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろしゃべったりしてたけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり、ずっと夢だし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと憧れの雑誌なのは変わらないし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにより、ファッションは楽しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねー！お母さん〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はこの日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"17thシングル「インフルエンサー」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特典映像を限定公開しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたたかい拍手すごくホッとしたよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売をお楽しみに。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/03/02/5745427/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャケ写は通常盤にいます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/03/02/5745427/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「インフルエンサー」MV解禁しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめえ誰だよ！状態ですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"詳しくは特典映像で、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"踊ってる最中"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"袖が顔にべんべん当たって大変でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人的に自分の踊り癖にぴったりはまる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"振付で嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分にはまるなーと思ったのは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はじめてかもしれない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと踊っていたくなるダンスです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/03/02/5745427/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"文化にいる幼馴染と久々に会えた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話は主にファッションブランドの情報交換。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きなことに直球でいきましょう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も頑張ろうと思えた日でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}